{"verse_key": "10:98", "surah": 10, "verse": 98, "text_uthmani": "فَلَوْلَا كَانَتْ قَرْيَةٌ ءَامَنَتْ فَنَفَعَهَآ إِيمَـٰنُهَآ إِلَّا قَوْمَ يُونُسَ لَمَّآ ءَامَنُوا۟ كَشَفْنَا عَنْهُمْ عَذَابَ ٱلْخِزْىِ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمَتَّعْنَـٰهُمْ إِلَىٰ حِينٍ", "translation": "Then has there not been a [single] city that believed so its faith benefited it except the people of Jonah? When they believed, We removed from them the punishment of disgrace in worldly life and gave them enjoyment [i.e., provision] for a time.", "verse_from_ms": 2108660, "verse_to_ms": 2133530, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَلَوْلَا", "start_ms": 2108660, "end_ms": 2110060}, {"i": 1, "text": "كَانَتْ", "start_ms": 2110060, "end_ms": 2110980}, {"i": 2, "text": "قَرْيَةٌ", "start_ms": 2110980, "end_ms": 2111890}, {"i": 3, "text": "ءَامَنَتْ", "start_ms": 2111890, "end_ms": 2112840}, {"i": 4, "text": "فَنَفَعَهَآ", "start_ms": 2112840, "end_ms": 2115190}, {"i": 5, "text": "إِيمَـٰنُهَآ", "start_ms": 2115190, "end_ms": 2117920}, {"i": 6, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 2117920, "end_ms": 2118650}, {"i": 7, "text": "قَوْمَ", "start_ms": 2118650, "end_ms": 2119240}, {"i": 8, "text": "يُونُسَ", "start_ms": 2119240, "end_ms": 2120150}, {"i": 9, "text": "لَمَّآ", "start_ms": 2120150, "end_ms": 2122380}, {"i": 10, "text": "ءَامَنُوا۟", "start_ms": 2122380, "end_ms": 2123260}, {"i": 11, "text": "كَشَفْنَا", "start_ms": 2123260, "end_ms": 2124280}, {"i": 12, "text": "عَنْهُمْ", "start_ms": 2124280, "end_ms": 2124990}, {"i": 13, "text": "عَذَابَ", "start_ms": 2124990, "end_ms": 2125750}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱلْخِزْىِ", "start_ms": 2125750, "end_ms": 2126600}, {"i": 15, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 2126600, "end_ms": 2126850}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ", "start_ms": 2126850, "end_ms": 2127760}, {"i": 17, "text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "start_ms": 2127760, "end_ms": 2128640}, {"i": 18, "text": "وَمَتَّعْنَـٰهُمْ", "start_m